reserve tool inputs/outputs, gate/force semantics, delivery fields, and workflow durability limit. Consumer: FastMCP; link-tool tests require all canonical relations.\n- `src/rebar/_opcert_signing.py:1-13, 79-108, 165-181, 298-355` — Preserve exclusive key genesis, read-only resolution, mismatch warning, principal/material binding, and signing behavior. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_opcert_verify.py:1-13, 25-43, 101-207, 241-329` — Preserve signed subject binding, trusted-key order, authenticated material/manifest use, and replay prevention. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_operation_config.py:1-29, 54-65, 230-326` — Preserve immutable snapshot, provenance vocabulary, reentrancy, root matching, and context-local binding. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_proc.py:1-26, 46-61, 113-223` — Preserve whole-process-group reap sequence, store-root distinction, durable cwd choice, and detached-child contract. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/config.py:13-114, 167-239, 251-283, 472-555` — Preserve public compatibility exports, exact precedence, cache invalidation, snapshot binding, and malformed-config postures. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/mcp_server.py:1-21, 105-116, 409-447, 595-673, 694-711` — Preserve exposed surfaces, environment registry, path-load necessity, stateless transport, proxy security, and signer composition. Consumer: `tests/interfaces/facades/test_mcp.py` requires the module docstring to say reads are in-process.\n- `src/rebar/mirror_guard.py:1-26` — Preserve two monitored failure modes, output/exit behavior, and remediation. Consumer: argparse uses the module docstring as command description.\n- `src/rebar/secret_screen.py:1-34, 58-100` — Preserve refuse-not-redact policy, audited override, fixed-window entropy rationale, and whole-line PEM discrimination. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/signing.py:1-22, 69-145, 282-324, 375-405` — Preserve scheme dispatch, compatibility read path, attestation selection, and CLI verification contract. Consumer: none found.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item and consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/python scripts/check_comment_hygiene.py`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make test`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/_mcp_serving.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/_mcp_writes.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/_opcert_signing.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/_opcert_verify.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/_operation_config.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/_proc.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/config.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/mcp_server.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/mirror_guard.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/secret_screen.py","reason":"Conde